<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JOL" style="id">Joel</book>
  <para style="h">Joel</para>
  <para style="toc1">Joel</para>
  <para style="toc2">Joel</para>
  <para style="mt">Joel</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pethuel tapa Joel kiang ah Toupa thu a hongtung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Putekte aw, hiai za un: hiai, nou hunlai leh na pute uh hunlai in a omkha ngeita ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huai pen na tate uh hilh unla, na tate un amau tate hilh uhenla, a ta nawnte un suan dang hilhsawn zel uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Singnget khau in a nek bang teng khauhon in a ne a, khauhon in a nek bang teng ka chita ngal a a ne a; khaukhup in a nek bang teng khaupe in a nekhinta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khamte aw, halh unla kap un; uain dawn tengteng aw, a uain khum ziak in kap vongvong un; na kam ua kipan lah uain lakmang ahita ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nam hat mahmah, simsenglouh in ka gam a hong douta uhi, humpinelkai liante ha bang in a hiam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka grepgui a hih sia ua ka theipi sing hawng a kheuh ua, a kheuh siangvek a, a paimang a; a hiangte a kiat ngou vek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nungak in, saiip puanteng a, a hoihlai pasal a sun bang in kap vongvong un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tangbuang latte, dawn ding latte Toupa inn a kipan hihman ahi a; siampu Toupa nasemte a lungkham uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lou hihsiat ahi a, gam a lungkham a; buh hihsiat ahi a, uain thak a kang a, sathau a ginata kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aw, nou louneimite aw, sun unla; aw, nou grepgui kemmite aw, huitbuh leh barli buh ziak in dah in mau ekek un; lou a buhlak ding a mangthang vekta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Grepgui a vuai a, theipi kung a vuai a; theibuhfai zung, tum leh apple theikung, lou a sing tengteng leng a vulta hi: mihing tate lak a kipahna lah a vuaimangta ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nou siampute aw, saiip puan teng unla kap un; nou maitam nasemmite aw, chiau vongvong un; nou ka Pathian na semmite aw, hongpai unla, saiip puan silh in zankhua in lum un: na Pathian inn ua pan tangbuang lat leh dawn ding lat kham ahita ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Anngawl hun tang siangthou in, khawmpi taksuak bawl unla, Toupa na Pathian inn ah putekte leh hiai gam a teng mi tengteng pikhawm unla, Toupa sam un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huai ni a tung a gik hi: Toupa ni lah a nai ngal a, Bangkim hihtheipa a kipan manthatna a hongtung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka mit muh in nekding hihman ahi ka hia, ahi, i nopna leh i kipahna i Pathian inn a kipan hihman ahi ka hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chite leikhal nuai ah a muat a; pangte lah a kigawp a, buh innte phel in a om a, a buhte a vuaita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Gante nak thum hinatel u e! bawnghonte a buai zak ua, loupa hing mun a neih louh ziak un; ahi, belamhonte a segawp uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw, Toupa k’on sam hi, mei in gamdai gam loupa mun a kangsiangta a, meikuang in gam a sing tengteng a kang siangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahi, gamsate nang honngai in a nak huhu ua; luitate a kangtat a, mei in gamdai gam loupa mun a kang siangta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zion ah pengkul mut unla ka tang siangthou ah kigalginna phuang un; hiai gamsung a mi tengteng ling uhen; Toupa ni hongtung ding, a naita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mialna leh khonimna ni, meikai ni leh mialsah ni, tangte tung a phalvak tangkhia bang a mipi thupitak leh hattak, huchibang om ngeinailou, tu nung a suan tampi tan a leng om nawn ngei samlou ding a hongtung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A maban uh mei in a kang siang a; a nunglam uh meikuang in a hul a; a ma uah gam lah Eden huan bang ahi, a nunglam uh gamdai gamkeu ahi a; ahi, bangmah in huai a pelkei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A latdan uh sakol latdan bang ahi; sakol tuangmi bang in a tai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kidouna kangtalai ging bang in tang tung ah a kilek suausuau ua, buhpawl kang kuang luahluah leh kidouna a mipi hattak mansa a bang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amaute mu mipite a lau ua; a melte uh a hong mualkhin uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi hattak bang in a tai ua; kidou mi bang in bang ah a kah ua, amau zawn chiat ah a pai ua, a kivolhdan uh a hihbuai kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A kiphu kha tuankei ua; amau lampi ah a paichiat ua; galvante a nawk paisuak ua, a pialzak kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khopi tung ah a tawm ua; kulh tung ah a tai ua; insungte ah a kaltou ua; guta bang in tohlette ah a lut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A ma uah lei a ling a; vante a ling hi; ni leh kha a mial a, aksite’n a vak uh a sel uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huan Toupa’n a sepaih honte ma ah a aw a suah a; a giahbukte lah a thupi nga la; a thu tangtungsakpa a hat a, Toupa ni a thupi in a mulkimhuai mahmah ngal a, kuan a thuak thei dia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa’n , Huchipi in leng tuin na lungtang tengteng ua anngawl in, kap in, lungkham in keilam hong nga le uchin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na puan uh hilou in na lungtang uh botkek unla Toupa na Pathian lam nga un; amah hehpihthei tak leh lainatna a dim, lungnel leh chitna hau, thil hoihlou a kipan kiknawn sek ahi, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un lungsim kihei in tangbuang leh dawn ding thillat ah vualzawlna nutsiat in a omkei ding chih kuan a thei a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zion ah pengkul mut unla, anngawl hun tang siangthou un, kikhoppi taksuaktak bawl un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mipi kaikhawm unla, kikhawm te hihsiangthou unla, putekte, naupangte, nawitui nelaite kaikhawm unla; mouneite a dantan a kipan in hongpawt uhenla, mou leng a dantan sunggil a kipan in hongpawt hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Siampu, Toupa nna semmite inlim leh maitam kikal ah kap uhenla; Toupa , na mite hawi inla, na goutante gensiat a om a namte’n a tung ua vai a hawmsak ding un pe ken; A Pathian uh koi a om ahita a, chi in a mipite lak ah bangdia chi ding ahi ua? chi uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Toupa’n a gam thikthuse khop in a deihthoh a, a mite a hehpih hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Toupa’n a mite kiang ah, Ngai unla, na kiang uah buhte, uainte, sathaute k’on tungsak ding a, huaite in na tai ding ua; namte lak ah gensiat in k’on omsak nawn hetkei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Himahleh na kiang ua kipan in mallam sepaihhon ka suanmang ding a, gamkeu leh sia ah ka paisak ding, amasa pawl suahlam tuipi ah, a nanung pawl tumlam tuipi ah; a hong uih khe ding a, namsetak in a hong nam ding, thil thupitak a hih ziak in, chi in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aw gam, lau ken, nuam in kipak in; Toupa’n thil thupite a hihta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Gante aw, lau kei un, gamdai loupa mun a hongsel a, sing a hong gah a, theipi kung leh grepgui a hong selpha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nou, Zion tate aw, kipak un, Toupa na Pathian uah nuam un; nou a ding in vuah a zusak a, kha khatna a vuah masa leh vuah nanung a hunlel a honpe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pialkhangte buhin a dim ding a, uain leh sathau belte a dimlet ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na lak ua ka sepaih hon tampi ka sawl, khaukhup te, singnget khaute, khauhonte, leh khaupete’n a nekkhit kumte nou k’on dinnawn ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tampi na ne ding ua, na tai ding ua, nou lamdangtak a hon ngaihtuah sekpa Toupa na Pathian min na phat ding uh; ka mite a zahlak ngeikei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huan Israelte lak ah ka om chih leh Toupa na Pathian uh ka hi, kuamah dang a omkei uh chih na thei ding uh; ka mite a zahlak ngei nawn kei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huai nungchiang in hichi a honghi ding a, mi tengteng tung ah ka kha ka sung ding; huchi in na tapate, na tanute un ka thu a gen ding ua, na putekte un mang a man ding ua, na tangvalte un kilaknate a mu ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in sikhapate, sikhanute tung ah leng ka kha ka sung baw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Van leh lei ah thillamdangte, sisan, mei leh meikhu ding ka musak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ni mial a suak ding a, kha sisan a suak ding hi, Toupa ni thupitak leh mulkimhuai a hongtun ma in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Huan, hichi ahi ding, kuapeuh Toupa min lou peuhmah humbit in a om ding hi; Toupa’n a gen bang in taikhete Zion tang ah leh Jerusalem khua ah a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngai dih ua, huai nite leh buai hun chiang in, Judah leh Jerusalem ah nam tengteng ka kaikhawm ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amaute Jehosaphat phaizang ah ka hon kaikhawm ding a; ka gam namte lak ah a hawmzak ua, ka mite a thehzak ziak un, Israel a ding in amaute ka lang ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka min a ding in ai a san ua; kizuak man ding in pasal naupang a pia ua, uain a dawn theihna ding un, a man ding in numei naupang a zuak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi, aw Tura leh Sidon leh Philistia gam tengteng aw, kei ading in bang na hi ua leh? Na thuk ding ua hia? N’on thuk uleh, hattak in, kintak in na thukna uh na lutung mahmah uah k’on thuksam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka dangkasik leh a dangkaeng na la ua, ka thilhoihtak deihhuaite na biakin sung uah na tawilut uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Judah tate leh Jerusalem tate leng a gamgi ua kipan a gamlapi ah na suanmang theihna ding un, Grik tapate kiang ah na zuakta uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngai dih ua, na zuakna mun ua kipan in tokthou in ka pawtsak ding a, na thukna uh na lutung mahmah uah ka thuk sam ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na tapate, na tanute uh Judah tate khut ah ka zuak ding, amau gamlapi ah Sheba mite kiang ah a zuak ding uhi, Toupa’n a chita hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hiai nam lak ah phuang unla; kidouna kisa unla; mihat mahmahte tokthou unla; kidoumi tengteng te hong nai uhenla, hong paitou uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na leilehna mukzumte uh namsau ding in sek unla na thei kung kuaika temtate uh teipi din sek un; mihatlou in leng ka hat chi hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A kim a nam tengteng aw, kin unla, hongpai unla ki kaikhawm un: Aw Toupa , huai ah na mihat mahmahte paisuk sak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Namte kitokthou uhenla Jehosaphat phaizang ah hong paitou uhen: huai ah a kim a nam tengteng tung a vaihawm ding in ka tu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na kawite uh suah un, buhlak a hun hi: hongpai unla, childen un; grep sukna khuk a dim a, bel a dimlet a; a khelhna uh a thupi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mipi tampite, thukhenna guam a mipi tampite! Thupukna phaizang ah, Toupa ni a naita hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ni leh kha hihmial in om ding ua, aksite’n a vakna uh a sel ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Toupa Zion tang a kipan in a humham ding a, Jerusalem khua a kipan in a aw a suah ding hi; Lei leh van a ling ding ua; himahleh Toupa a mite ading in kihumbitna leh Israel suante ading in insang ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa na Pathian uh ka tang siangthou Zion a teng ka hi chih na thei ding uh; huchi in, Jerusalem khua a siangthou ding a, mikhual kuamah a paisuak nawn hetkei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in hichi ahi ding a, tang sangte’n uain khum a kai sak ding ua, tangte nawitui in a luang ding a; Toupa inn a kipan in tuikhuk a hong kikhohkhe ding a, Shittim luiguam a nawmsak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Judah tate tung ah engbawl tak a a gam uah sisan a suah ziak un, Aigupta a segawp ding a, Edom gam gamdai gamkeu a suak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Judah gam tangtawn in luah in a om gige ding a, Jerusalem khua suan a kipan suanzel tan in luah in a om ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huan a sisan suahna uh ka sawpsiang louh ka sawpsiang ding a, Toupa Zion ah a teng gige hi.
  </para>
</usx>
